<title>USA: United Dominion says tenders Core shares.</title>
<headline>United Dominion says tenders Core shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Industries Ltd said Thursday its UD Nevada Corp unit tendered about 92.6 percent of Core Industries Inc's outstanding shares on a fully diluted basis.</p>
<p>The company said it tendered 9.958 million shares at $25 per share, based on a preliminary count.</p>
<p>Following the acquisition of Core Industries, United Dominion will become a $1.9 billion company with 11,000 employees at 65 manufacturing locations in 14 countries.</p>
</text>
